{
 "info": {
  "_postman_id": "or-task-subject-identifier-2026-11-25",
  "name": "OpenRegister Task Subject Identifier",
  "description": "The task inbox names a task's subject by its identifier (change task-subject-identifier, task 1.5).\n\nWHAT IT ASSERTS: a task created on a case whose `identifier` is set carries `subject.identifier` in the create answer, in its `GET /api/flow-tasks` row and in `GET /api/flow-tasks/{uuid}`; a task on a case without one carries `subject.identifier: null` (CONTROL).\n\nHermetic: it creates its schema, register, cases and tasks; the tasks are cancelled (there is no task delete route) and the rest removed.",
  "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
 },
 "auth": {
  "type": "basic",
  "basic": [
